<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Your video call has been scheduled.</p>
<ul>
  <li>When: <%= @scheduled_time.in_time_zone(@scheduled.scheduled_tz || Time.zone.name).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %></li>
  <% if @join_url.present? %>
  <li>Join link: <a href="<%= @join_url %>"><%= @join_url %></a></li>
  <% else %>
  <li>Join: Open your chat window at the scheduled time to join the call.</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>We look forward to speaking with you.</p>